  Perhaps this does not answer your question, but bridi do not operate on
bridi, they operate on sumti.  There is a way to turn a bridi into a sumti,
of course, which is with abstractions (lo nu broda kei ku, for example).

   As for "usefulness", I'm not sure what extra functionally you are
seeking beyond what already exists within lojban?

                   --gejyspa



